@startuml
title SABLE baseline-to-candidate obligation activity
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam activity {
  FontSize 20
  DiamondFontSize 18
  BackgroundColor #F5F8FC
  BorderColor #34506B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF2D8
  DiamondBorderColor #B7791F
  ArrowColor #536B82
}
start
:Load trusted baseline, candidate Terraform/HCL,\nand registered principal, asset, and actions;
if (Baseline has resources?) then (yes)
  if (Parsing and obligation inputs are complete?) then (yes)
    :Verify registered obligation against baseline access;
    if (Baseline obligation independently holds?) then (yes)
      :Parse candidate resources and references;
      :Rank candidate resource successors using\nsupported identity and continuity signals;
      if (One supported successor and principal binding?) then (yes)
        :Project required actions and resource scope\nonto the selected successor;
        if (Authorization result is fully known?) then (yes)
          if (Obligation still holds?) then (yes)
            :Record PRESERVED evidence;
          else (no)
            :Record REGRESSED evidence;
          endif
        else (no)
          :Record UNKNOWN with model-boundary reason;
        endif
      else (no)
        :Record UNKNOWN with correspondence reason;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Record UNKNOWN; baseline is not trusted;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Record UNKNOWN; parsing or obligation is incomplete;
  endif
else (no)
  :Record NOT_APPLICABLE; no continuity claim;
endif
stop
note right
Bounded local Terraform/HCL S3 and IAM analysis.
Unsupported semantics remain UNKNOWN; no Terraform apply,
live AWS query, or universal Terraform claim is implied.
end note
@enduml
